    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know youre trying to be nice but it doesn't change the reality. things just keep getting worse. my partner is working two jobs just to keep us afloat and i'm just another mouth to feed, another person they have to worry about. it's like i'm just a heavy weight that they're constantly dragging along. i feel like the more i try, the more i just get in the way of them actually being happy.",
